**5. AI evaluation:** Actual measured results, if evaluation was performed. Otherwise, state exactly what remains unevaluated. Never invent metrics.

**6. Remaining weaknesses:** Important limitations, unresolved bugs, and external verification requirements.

**7. Next priorities:** Only the highest-impact remaining work, ordered by importance.

Do not claim the application is extraordinary, production-ready, validated, secure, or dependable merely because you have finished editing it. Describe what the evidence supports.

